{"title": "上游一压缩，替换就失灵", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si -H 'Accept-Encoding: gzip' localhost/page.html | grep -i encoding"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "Content-Encoding: gzip"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "压缩字节流被原样透传：字面匹配无从谈起"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "proxy_set_header Accept-Encoding \"\";"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -H 'Accept-Encoding: gzip' localhost/page.html"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "<p><a href=\"http://new.example.com/b\">b</a></p>"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "告诉上游要明文：替换恢复工作，三处全换"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
